	                    <div id="aboutTabsContent" class="tab-content" style="padding-top: 10px;">
	                        <div class="tab-pane fade active in" id="about">
	                            
	                            <div class="panel panel-primary">
	                                <div class="panel-heading">
	                                    About
	                                </div>
	                                <ul class="list-group">
	                                	<li class="list-group-item"><b>Texas Flood Imagery</b><br>
										This imagery was acquired on July 10 2025 by the NOAA Remote Sensing Division to support NOAA homeland security and emergency response requirements. In addition, it will be used for ongoing research efforts for testing and developing standards for airborne digital imagery. Individual images have been combined into a larger mosaic and tiled for distribution. The approximate ground sample distance (GSD) for each pixel is 15 - 30 cm / zoom level 20 - 19.
										</li>
	                                	<li class="list-group-item"><b>Midwest U.S. Flood Imagery</b><br>
										This imagery was acquired on April 10-13 2025 by the NOAA Remote Sensing Division to support NOAA homeland security and emergency response requirements. In addition, it will be used for ongoing research efforts for testing and developing standards for airborne digital imagery. Individual images have been combined into a larger mosaic and tiled for distribution. The approximate ground sample distance (GSD) for each pixel is 15 - 30 cm / zoom level 20 - 19.
										</li>
	                                    <li class="list-group-item"><b>California Fire Imagery</b><br>
	                            		The imagery from January 8-20 2025 was downloaded from Maxar's Open Data Program. The following command will list the available
	                                    directories containing pre and post event imagery on Amazon S3. The approximate ground sample distance (GSD) for each pixel is 30 cm / zoom level 19.
	                                    <br>
	                                    <br>
	                                    aws s3 --no-sign-request ls s3://maxar-opendata/events/WildFires-LosAngeles-Jan-2025/ard/11/
	                                    <br>
	                                    <br>
	                                    This imagery from January 28 2025 was acquired by the NOAA Remote Sensing Division to support emergency response requirements. Individual images have been combined into a larger mosaic and tiled for distribution. The approximate ground sample distance (GSD) for each pixel is 7.5 cm / zoom level 21.
										</li>
										
	                                </ul>
	                            </div>
	                        </div>
